@base = http://localhost:8080/api/support-orders

### Crear
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalReference": "MOB-2001",
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "category": "PAYMENT",
  "description": "El pago aparece como pendiente después de varios minutos.",
  "channel": "MOBILE_APP",
  "priority": "MEDIUM"
}

### Listar (filtro opcional)
GET {{base}}?status=OPEN

### Detalle
GET {{base}}/1

### Cambiar estado
PATCH {{base}}/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "IN_PROGRESS" }

### Transición inválida (RESOLVED -> OPEN) => 409
PATCH {{base}}/3/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "OPEN" }
